3nrfmq4><a href=\"/contacts/\" data-astro-cid-o3nrfmq4=\"true\" data-astro-cid-s6shze65=\"true\" class=\"CtaButton -size-md -fill\"><span class=\"border\" data-astro-cid-s6shze65></span><span class=\"ripple\" data-astro-cid-s6shze65><span data-astro-cid-s6shze65></span></span><span class=\"title\" data-astro-cid-s6shze65><span data-text=\"Contacts\" data-astro-cid-s6shze65>Contacts</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"grid__col -toggle\" data-astro-cid-o3nrfmq4><button class=\"toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\" data-astro-cid-o3nrfmq4><span data-astro-cid-o3nrfmq4></span><span data-astro-cid-o3nrfmq4></span></button></div></div></div></div></header><main class=\"View\"><article class=\"ArticleSection\" data-astro-cid-t2ijxtow><div class=\"Container container\" data-astro-cid-t2ijxtow=\"true\" data-astro-cid-7bogrbt7><div class=\"header\" data-astro-cid-t2ijxtow><h1 data-astro-cid-t2ijxtow>Privacy policy</h1></div><div class=\"text\" data-astro-cid-t2ijxtow><p>Effective date: September 09, 2024</p><p> Cuberto Inc (\"us\", \"we\", or \"our\") operates the <a href=\"https://cuberto.com/\">https://cuberto.com/</a> website (the \"Service\"). This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your personal data when you visit and use our Service, and your rights in relation to that data.</p><p></p><p> <b>1. Information we collect</b></p><p><b>1.1 Personal Data</b></p><p>You may provide us with certain personal data, e.g.:<ul><li>Name, email address</li><li>Company name, position</li><li>Other contact data submitted by you</li></ul></p><p><b>1.2 Usage data</b></p><p>We automatically collect usage data when you use our Service, including:<ul><li>IP address, browser type and version</li><li>Pages you visited, timestamps, duration</li><li>Device identifiers, operating system version</li><li>Clicks, interactions, navigation paths</li></ul></p><p><b>1.3 Cookies & tracking technologies</b></p><p>We use cookies, web beacons, tags, scripts, and similar tracking technologies to track activity and collect information:<ul><li>Session cookies</li><li>Preference cookies</li><li>Security cookies</li></ul></p><p>You can set your browser to refuse cookies or to notify you \u2014 but this may limit your use of some features.</p><p></p><p><b>2. How we use data</b></p><p>We use collected data for purposes such as:<ul><li>Providing, operating, and maintaining the Service</li><li>Improving and personalizing the Service</li><li>Communicating with you (notifications, support)</li><li>Analytics and monitoring usage</li><li>Preventing fraud, abuse, or technical issues</li></ul></p><p>Our processing is based on lawful grounds, such as:<ul><li>Your consent (e.g. for cookies, newsletter)</li><li>Performance of a contract (e.g. delivering services)</li><li>Legitimate interests (e.g. improving UX, analytics)</li></ul></p><p></p><p><b>3. Data transfer</b></p><p>Your information may be transferred to, stored, and processed in countries different from your own, including the United States. We will ensure adequate protections (e.g. standard contractual clauses, data protection agreements) to safeguard your data.</p><p></p><p><b>4. Disclosure of data</b></p><p>We may disclose your Personal Data if required by law or to protect rights, property, or safety. We also may share data with third-party service providers who perform functions on our behalf (analytics, hosting, tools), under confidentiality obligations.</p><p></p><p><b>5. Data security</b></p><p>We implement security measures (e.g. encryption, access controls, monitoring) to protect your personal data. Still, no system is completely foolproof, so we cannot guarantee absolute security. We will retain your data only as long as necessary for the purposes for which it was collected, or as required by law.</p><p></p><p><b>6. Your rights</b></p><p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have rights to:<ul><li>Access your personal data</li><li>Correct or update it</li><li>Delete it (\u201cright to be forgotten\u201d)</li><li>Restrict or object to processing</li><li>Port your data (data portability)</li><li>Withdraw consent at any time (where processing is based on consent)</li></ul></p><p>To exercise these rights, contact us at info@cuberto.com.</p><p> We will respond within applicable statutory timeframes.</p><p></p><p><b>7. Cookies</b></p><p>We provide more detailed cookie-notice and allow you to control which categories of cookies are used (strictly necessary, preferences, analytics, marketing).</p><p></p><p><b>8. Children</b></p><p>Our Service is not intended for children under 16. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children. If we discover such data was submitted, we will promptly delete it.</p><p></p><p><b>9. Changes to this Privacy Policy</b></p><p>We may update this policy from time to time. We will notify you of significant changes (e.g. via email or prominent notice) and update the \u201cEffective date\u201d at the top.</p><p></p><p><b>10. Contact us</b></p><p>If you have any questions or requests regarding this Privacy Policy, contact us at: <a href=\"mailto:info@cuberto.com\">info@cuberto.com</a></p></div></div></article><section class=\"OutroSection\" data-astro-cid-ejdhoips><div class=\"bg\" data-astro-cid-ejdhoips><div class=\"bg__media\" data-astro-cid-ejdhoips><img src=\"/_astro/bg.BbFVEA79_ZPnPpw.jpg?dpl=dpl_GqmhdavyaeYRRMJdnig1N8V3anEA\" srcset=\"/_astro/bg.BbFVEA79_ZPnPpw.jpg?dpl=dpl_GqmhdavyaeYRRMJdnig1N8V3anEA 1x, /_astro/bg.BbFVEA79_21cPbT.jpg?dpl=dpl_GqmhdavyaeYRRMJdnig1N8V3anEA 2x\" alt data-astro-cid-ejdhoips=\"true\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1920\" height=\"692\"></div></div><div class=\"content\" data-astro-cid-ejdhoips><div class=\"Container\" data-astro-cid-ejdhoips=\"true\" data-astro-cid-7bogrbt7><div class=\"header\" data-astro-cid-ejdhoips><h2 data-astro-cid-ejdhoips>Have a product to build or rethink?</h2></div><div class=\"text\" data-astro-cid-ejdhoips><p data-astro-cid-